// Unchanged except for the comment below â€” the orchestrator was already correct: its
// ranked stage promotes against activePromoteFloor(), which resolves the human-calibrated
// dev_control floor first and falls back to DEV_POLICY.promoteFloor. The divergence was
// in the manual promote route, which bypassed the floor entirely; it now imports
// activePromoteFloor from here, so both promote paths read one floor.

